  "scenes": [
    { "id": "knoll", "x": -50.0, "y": -2.0, "level": 1, "note": "The grassy knoll with the bonfire place: between the warden's house and the lighthouse, south of the concrete path (marked on three reference photographs); placed by eye from those marks, within about 15 m." },
    { "id": "docks", "x": -101.0, "y": 100.0, "level": 2, "note": "The jetty on the north shore behind the warden's house's east end (the reference aerial photograph, option C); the place is the jetty's middle, out over the water, placed by eye on the orthophoto's shore, within about 10 m. Level 2 is AX-3 provisional." },
    { "id": "port", "x": 34.5, "y": -90.0, "level": 2, "note": "The southern port, where most visitors land: the wider stone dock at the slipway south of the lighthouse (most visitors arrive at the southern docks, a wider stone dock; the north jetty is the warden's). The place is the slipway's foot by the water, where the map draws the pier. Painted in the 1991 game's manner, not as the place is (it need not look one to one). Level 2 is AX-3 provisional." },
    { "id": "crossroads", "x": -85.0, "y": 38.5, "level": 2, "note": "The concrete path's Y fork west of the lighthouse: the left arm to the green hut with the chimney, the right arm on to the lighthouse (the reference photograph). The place is the fork of the traced tracks. AX-3 provisional: level 2, the next after the knoll." },
    { "id": "terrace", "x": -128.0, "y": 32.0, "level": 2, "note": "The terrace before the main door of the warden's house (the front of the house, in the manner of the 1991 game; the marks on the reference drone photograph: the terrace, looking away from the house, slightly south-west). The place is the deck's seaward edge toward the shingle, a little out from the terrace landmark so its mark on the map stands clear of the house's; placed by eye, within about 8 m. Level 2 is AX-3 provisional." },
    { "id": "square", "x": 14.0, "y": -20.0, "level": 2, "note": "The village square: the open ground between the lighthouse's side building, the cinema and engine-room house and the old boat shed, seen from the lighthouse's south-west foot looking east-south-east toward the southern pier. Painted as a small town plaza on a hill in the manner of the 1991 game, not as the place is. Level 2 is AX-3 provisional." }
